        <item>
            <title>2.5.7</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 22:41:15 +0545</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/kshitijsubedi/nepali-calendar-mac-updates/raw/refs/heads/main/versions/nepali-calendar-mac-2.5.7-38.dmg</link>
            <sparkle:version>38</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.5.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Calendar Data Fixes
- Aasoj 2083 now shows 31 days instead of 30. Mangsir, Poush, and Magh 2083 were wrong by a day each in a way that cancelled out, so only Aasoj looked off; all four are corrected.
- Fixed Chaitra in 2095, 2096, and 2097. Chaitra 2096 was two days short, leaving that year with 364 days.
]]></description>
