            <link>https://github.com/kshitijsubedi/nepali-calendar-mac-updates/raw/refs/heads/main/versions/nepali-calendar-mac-2.5.6-37.dmg</link>
            <sparkle:version>37</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.5.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Events List Redesign
- Card-style rows with clearer titles, notes, and date & time.
- Today's and upcoming events appear first; past events are dimmed at the end.

## Fixes
- Day tooltip text was unreadable on light theme; it now matches the active theme.
]]></description>
