            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.5.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.1</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Event Fixes
- Fixed the app closing when picking a date while creating an event.
- Long event lists now scroll, keeping "Add Event" always reachable.
- Calendar events now show the date alongside the time.
- Past events are dimmed in the list.
]]></description>
